  id: cavestalker
  displayName: Cavestalker
  description: Predator. Hunts other cave fauna. Will attack the player if surprised.
  behaviors:
  - Stalks in silence until close.
  - Pounces from above or hidden alcoves.
  - Doesn't pursue if player escapes line-of-sight.
  - Can be tamed (very rare) into a powerful melee companion.
  habitat: Cave Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - Predator Meat x2
  - Thick Pelt x1
  - Sharp Bone Tip x1-2
  isTameable: 1
  isPassive: 0
  isAggressive: 0
  baseHealth: 50
  baseSpeed: 3
